    "EMS Synthi AKS 1972 portable synthesizer briefcase touch keyboard pin matrix",
    "Synthi AKS digi-sequencer 256 steps touch keyboard programming EMS London",
    "Pink Floyd On the Run Synthi AKS Alan Parsons EMS Zinovieff Cockerell"
  ],
  "research": {
